          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 433060,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "We could consider some gourmet sweet biscuits, but let's stick to the 'local harvest' theme to keep the concept strong. Standard chips might dilute the premium feel we're aiming for.",
            "mentions": [
              186687
