            "speaker_id": 128528,
            "reply_to": "M8",
            "text": "Okay, sounds like we have a consensus forming. Let's lock in the main product categories. Proposal: Artisanal Cheeses, Cured Meats, Crackers/Artisan Bread, and Local Preserves/Jams. This will be our focus for the assortment plan in A1.",
            "mentions": [],
